  "details": "\"I attempted to upload an avatar to VRchat. While the upload process completed successfully within Unity, without any reported errors, the avatar failed to populate within the in-game avatar selection menu. After encountering this issue, I searched online for potential causes and found information suggesting that it may take several hours for the avatar to appear. However, I encountered a similar problem approximately two weeks prior, and that avatar has yet to be reflected in my list. As a result, I am submitting this feedback to bring this persistent issue to your attention. Thank you for taking the time to read this.\"",
